<title>USA: First Tenn approves $130 mln shr buyback.</title>
<headline>First Tenn approves $130 mln shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Tennessee National Corp on Monday said its board of directors approved the repurchase of up to $130 million of its common stock.</p>
<p>The program will expire Dec. 31, 1998, the company said. Repurchases will be made from time to time in the open market or through privately negotiated transactions, the company said.</p>
<p>Earlier Monday, the stock rose 3/4 to 37-3/4 in trading on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
